LED
- LED anode (+, long leg) → ESP32 GPIO 25
- LED cathode (−, short leg) → 220Ω resistor → GND
Buzzer
- Buzzer + → ESP32 GPIO 27
- Buzzer − → ESP32 GND
Wi-Fi / Blynk
- No physical connections required.
- ESP32 connects to Wi-Fi wirelessly.
- Blynk controls:
  - V0 → LED ON/OFF
  - V1 → Buzzer ON/OFF
